{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":160,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":160,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":340,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/avatar.png","skin":"露营","skin_cn":"露营"},{"id":507,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/%E7%9D%A1%E8%A1%A3/hare.png","skin":"睡衣","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"小钩","given_name":"晴","family_name_jp":"小鈎","given_name_jp":"ハレ","family_name_kr":"오마가리","given_name_kr":"하레","family_name_en":"Omagari","given_name_en":"Hare","family_name_zh_tw":"小鈎","given_name_zh_tw":"晴","family_name_cn":"小钩","given_name_cn":"晴","nick_name":"小勾八","momo_talk_signature":"急事私敲","main_relation":36,"relation":null,"age":16,"grade":"二年生","height":153,"birthday":"04-19","hobby":"游戏","designer":"9ml","illustrator":"9ml","character_voice":"贝原怜奈","character_voice_cn":"秦文静","release_date":"2021-02-04","release_date_cn":"2023-08-03","release_date_global":"2021-11-09","school":4,"weapon_type":"AR","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":true,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Medium","special_appearance":false,"spine":[266,455],"model":[26,380],"voice":[{"description":"Hare_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案。","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/cwtl8J8ujE2jws4wQHZPe6zBPt2JYhh7.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Battle_In_1","category":"battle","text":"好，来尽情地搞一搞破坏吧。","text_original":"さあ、思い切りかき回してみようか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/U1IDKWVZASyGmZfhDrde4NR5HAEsp1Of.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Battle_In_2","category":"battle","text":"首先，收集一下数据吧。","text_original":"まずは、データを集めてみようか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/equaNGUh0zLEkxlAJD4A6KE4ENKgvhiA.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Battle_TSA_1","category":"battle","text":"Tech level 7,登记完毕。","text_original":"テックレベル7、登場完了。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/dy2nKayEwgox4iF4AWkmbkyqTqNjcP6B.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Battle_TSA_2","category":"battle","text":"就用这一击，作为结束吧。","text_original":"これで終わらせよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/63GPSSCGRANWUXWJ8mhbCPcbAapjExHT.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Cafe_Act_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里可以这么修，那里再那样修一下......好。马上改造一下试试吧。","text_original":"これをこうやって直して、あそこをああやって直せば… よし。すぐ改造してみようかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/3cxUOlbW9k9UyoeXYxbUgWLNNtdOjHAs.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Cafe_Act_2","category":"cafe","text":"唔——嗯？啊，问我在干什么？在玩新出的游戏呢。","text_original":"ふーん。うん？ ああ、何してるかって？新作のゲームを やってたの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/eKQMESeRXlNokG1zoITQjHMYYvp6eU0w.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"不能让自动售货机只卖能量饮料吗......？","text_original":"自販機からエナジードリンクだけが出るようにはできないのかな…？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/98yXRQlxrCAF7zyLtfElBd6RutTFowO5.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"唔晤......要不要先眯一会再继续呢？","text_original":"ううーん…。ちょっと一眠りしてから続けようかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/199rTu2cJw80Vsllk12r0OKW0e7HFBWs.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"糖分不足......","text_original":"糖分が足りない…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/aZovQkkDqUQUyv3Bf2H2sGgu8wSn4f5J.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"这下会很痛哦。","text_original":"これは痛いよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/m5TjoQEbvCwQ5fnWl8tp6wVnWhWYmjzP.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"电磁脉冲，开始运行。","text_original":"電磁パルス、稼働開始。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/UsnYJbncsBrApF3mbn6DCCuknPor9Du0.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"EMP无人机，启动。","text_original":"EMPドローン、稼働。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/3P8QqmPlJJlS9lTT5FlYgCQTDiXBpxZ9.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"第一阶段发射器，开始运行。","text_original":"第一段階ユニッター、作動開始。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/NQZBJwzkXqyJZkgpqDy6vodrDClBKdzG.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"设备停止。","text_original":"装備を停止する。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/m2MyLTg2QYpoGrrKNAky6Gvu6YvxfqSt.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"和预期一样啊。","text_original":"予想通りかぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/4EfuSncxZaeWvpO5QHPKRUKyQ2HEQRb2.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"大家，退后。","text_original":"みんな、後ろに下がって。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/yzNQgCHIVraBxIa1Lv8UJylzzq4LcGbo.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"虽然是一件旧武器，不过这件武器里面，包含着无法量化的记忆。","text_original":"古い武器だけど……この武器には数値化できない思い出が込められてる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/JQ6hBP2RTKQdVfEdg6u4PdOwGi33hmdO.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"证明我实力的机会到了。","text_original":"私の実力を、証明してみせる機会だね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/qKgZpDflppsPjEyb6mHpVq30aspJhhMP.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"交给我吧。","text_original":"任せて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Osq8RTdnF7yqn5yz8uccARg9a0JD3Jr5.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"很高兴认识你，老师。我会让老师见识一下，千禧年的实力。","text_original":"会えて嬉しい、先生。 ミレニアムの力を、先生に見せてあげる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/yijVxVcrsbTXuJbZv253qEhTURw9tZ6j.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"嗯——效果还挺惊人的嘛。","text_original":"ん～、これは目を見張る結果だね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/s83I4R7pcRWVTfEf4ITCoNbEgAD3ZWa5.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"我还需要更多的数据。","text_original":"もっと多くのデータが必要だね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/EPpz1qwQ7K0zKoLJfR6LtypyqdI9kMP5.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"涌现出来的这股力量，能不能量化出来呢？","text_original":"この込み上げる力も、数値化出来るのかなぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/bvx7AqFaNuCSs3cozpLTPacBkeUha8DY.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"探索未知的知识，总是很有趣的。","text_original":"未知の知識を探求するのは、いつだって楽しいことだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/UnCB14uyBDLITQrzI4DTjUFAGyxlObqr.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"看不出来吧，我超会打游戏的哦。老师要不要和我比试一下？","text_original":"こう見えてゲームは結構上手い方だよ。 先生も一度相手してみる？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/aeZBH64qT7dbosTTkM8DzS5xshYHl7lf.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"作弊......？虽然我是黑客，但是打游戏最重要的是开心嘛。我不会作弊的。","text_original":"チート…？いくらハッカーでも、楽しさのためにやってるゲームにそんなのを使うはずないでしょ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/9bztAL9BCdHFiaP1lAF9Ih5sh4g3phZ9.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"在你看来，我们做的事情有那么极端吗？","text_original":"私たちがやることが、そんなに過激に見えた?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/E9savPEsmYTBDTw8cUIHswX5X1iGXjuJ.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"知识应该是自由的......嗯，这句话说的真好。","text_original":"知識は自由であるべき…。うん、やっぱりいい言葉だね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Mm1ZlUaRonXHfJJOFm4Oat7YAhoQmHTc.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"这种甜甜的碳酸饮料，才是高智商人士该喝的东西呢。","text_original":"この甘い炭酸飲料こそ、知性ある人の飲み物だよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/oCnYf1WsU7uVCBPmvIsnPLIOaLitSNkj.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"呀，老师。来杯咖啡吗？","text_original":"や、先生。コーヒーはいかが？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/zDDLbzgPnomGXt9tGYAq7gZPsMVoTJVV.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎你，老师。你比我预测的早到了43秒呢。","text_original":"ようこそ、先生。私の予想より約43秒早く到着したね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/gJx5p9ZWyyAk58OGvV5HZvDc7Ud7jnB5.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯......怎么突然下雨了......","text_original":"ふう…急に夕立だなんて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/b2WNP9W2tVPNEskCZPBM5yV6JuClbBXo.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"最近连天气预报都不敢信了，真麻烦。","text_original":"最近は、天気予報も信頼できなくて困るね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Yi7vVbmLKHjUAwg7b2haW3j1IimLPfPF.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，接下来该干什么呢？","text_original":"さて…この後、何をしようか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/cbNE6DdPyXK0kDH8W37xKo2zT7hKxmFi.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"（额，我刚才说的话，不会被误解成什么不好的意思吧？）","text_original":"（ん…今の言葉、もしかして変な意味に聞こえたかな？）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/kwM2coP0dr8EX6n3m7sLPOVbWmn5qL3o.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"（可我第一次来网吧这种地方，也不知道别人一般会在这里干什么......）","text_original":"（でも、ネットカフェなんて私も初めてだし、 普通こういう所で何をするものなのかも知らないし…）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/bTC9ugWRpChgWfAi7PgStRsunKTDzW0U.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"（而且这里，也太窄了......老师的脸，好近......）","text_original":"（というかこの空間、狭くて…先生の顔が近い…っ）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/ozZ7z7ZYO6VyodqI7w4y2qU65660Z3S0.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"欸？你要先去洗个澡？等下，为什么？！","text_original":"え、さ、先にシャワーを浴びてくるって？ちょっと、なっ、どうして？！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/PofM8irBhMRrc4zDfSZhUV1DdhNJjXHf.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊？头发淋湿了，要去洗一下？对不起，没事，当我没说吧。","text_original":"あ、雨に濡れたから、髪を洗いに？…ごめん、いや、気にしないで。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Mg4adms0gIi6dB5xYIn8G3Fg7SxKanYS.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_4_3","category":"lobby","text":"原来，网吧还有洗澡的地方啊。","text_original":"ネットカフェには、シャワーの設備もあるんだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/jDAIFGv0kdbtxO9XkpzPHYDRLAbFIITw.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师快看，饮料是免费的欸。不知道有没有能量饮料？","text_original":"あ、見て、先生。ドリンクバーが無料だって。 エナジードリンクもあるかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/UDKZUWD7fe2a7KyFZ9TxCB74KqdP3Qs2.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，网络也能随便用，饮料也不要钱。","text_original":"ネットも自由に使えるし、ドリンクも無料だし。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/1h32OUOuuLfuDi3x29KUBPL3Gzc5pmZu.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"这也太幸福了。完全就是给我这种人设计的地方啊。","text_original":"これは素晴らしい、完全に私のような人間のための空間。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/SROneU9HmTSUTgCMR2Kmwps4iRTOtr5B.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_6_1","category":"lobby","text":"要在这里待多久我都愿意。","text_original":"ここになら、いつまででもずっと、居られそうだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/ntHtBPQfBtfTFVNmlWCwqvFovE23GgL4.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_MemorialLobby_6_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，那个......刚才那句话没什么特别的意思，不要误会啊。","text_original":"あ、えっと…今のも、別に変な意味ではないから。誤解しないでね…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/gpZPEK0a7TtZ5asbLheBe1xGCzzH629w.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"等这项研究结束了，下次想研究一下老师。","text_original":"この研究が終わったら、次は先生のことを研究してみたいな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/mnYGgmito7FiZPXJ4wxzsdsk4g6fOi6R.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"要是人的心灵，也可以用显微镜去观察就好了。","text_original":"人の心も、顕微鏡で覗き込んで、見ることが出来たら良いのに…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/3zmyf4jJNFmPdSq02KygsxLwEBs1LUxT.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"用什么样的力学，才能证明这颗被老师吸引的心呢？","text_original":"先生に惹かれるこの心は、どんな力学で証明できるんだろう…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/zqQWnAqq4cfqFtfC11NAZBvUpMja6TLj.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"你问我的能力能不能让时间倒流？谁知道呢？但是我，很想永远享受现在这个瞬间。","text_original":"私の能力で時間を巻き戻せるのかって？ さぁ…でも私はこの瞬間を永遠に楽しみたいけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/9u0JVmn9KN8tLWXwi4otWl3Kvc02c5Iz.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"嗯——我说的树莓派不是这个东西。不过，谢谢你为我庆祝生日。","text_original":"うーん、私が言ったラズベリーパイはこれじゃないけど…。 でも誕生日を祝ってくれてありがとう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/pPtui5xZ5JPlxd1kfnqAZsAANsMv7O4B.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"生日快乐，老师。给你施加今天一天不管写什么代码都不会出现漏洞的晴之加护吧。","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとう、先生。 今日一日はどんなコードを書いてもバグが出ない、ハレのご加護を授けよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/guF8G61lNHMhqdeztHSHTAMMEmCG1qy1.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"你问我为什么不去外面参加庆典？万圣节的庆典，用显示器也能看嘛。","text_original":"外のお祭りを楽しみに出かけないのかって? ハロウィーンのお祭りはモニターの中でも開かれているもの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/rO5aZdUugasmjbHlu2I5lRsM1sjBDbpN.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"Hello, new world.","text_original":"ハロー、ニューワールド。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/HJSm0ynhiegwng1Tw6FKlKGVNzcp9UAd.ogg"},{"description":"Hare_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"老师，你知道吗？一年之中，圣诞节是发生“那个”次数最多的一天。哼哼，没错。就是——破解入侵哦。","text_original":"あれ知ってる、先生？ クリスマスは1年の中で“あれ”が一番多く行われる日なの。 ふふ、それはそう…ハッキングだよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/x9j2ytUGAXqEzeuho0pmkZgOaKhWSuvM.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"hare_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive.","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/NonQa69OE7bsDduPKOqlG0RqyYdLBfcn.ogg"},{"description":"hare_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"好，来尽情地搞一搞破坏吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Gl9QBMeEsXQu9iPNwIB5j0Vas5JQgacj.ogg"},{"description":"hare_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"先来，收集一下数据吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/HFy0dI9ud0jXqSKyptLl6UDR0sUpV2AN.ogg"},{"description":"hare_battle_tsa_1","category":"battle","text":"Tech level 7,登记完毕。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/4cWbyAfcWNd8PggDaXsC7P0MdWbZ5PCs.ogg"},{"description":"hare_battle_tsa_2","category":"battle","text":"就用这一击，作为结束吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/UgtqksI3nVmmBo5ybzpZzl5TQkWrZwL7.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里可以这么修，那里再那样修一下......好。马上改造一下试试吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/5hBarvEiILETUAUS0LTZTG7QMP2eYLZE.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_act_2","category":"cafe","text":"唔——嗯？啊，问我在干什么？在玩新出的游戏呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/3rKS4Sv13bzwncl4rvG00edCYviARiXX.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"不能让自动售货机只卖能量饮料吗......？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/tTKrsv5t9P656m8yNs0t1un1P0vCP2C3.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"唔晤......要不要先眯一会再继续呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/X57vMaTIRHq51ow4wh8EZ8adZBOuyvWA.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"糖分不足......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/H47h21F6ci73X2MseyV6jay9E5HwgHKw.ogg"},{"description":"hare_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"这下会很痛哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/X8BCFSzWmUIkuLcHOpftaiIPQzWe9xDb.ogg"},{"description":"hare_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"电磁脉冲，开始运行。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/46q6skVGxIYq3WK2fjB1t4pAiBKqshTc.ogg"},{"description":"hare_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"EMP无人机，启动。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Sh1Kv1NK7pFerqNl1wgftU6mdKDE67eB.ogg"},{"description":"hare_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"第一阶段发射器，开始运行。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/4fBHtzSl2IqHVYZdMn1SCykIYdUjBeJu.ogg"},{"description":"hare_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"设备停止。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/p4gvnXo6pa7kmOHfTL0jq5WGOZdYdZ2i.ogg"},{"description":"hare_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"和预期一样啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/38odSBV5HgQ4Y51jx5MgPwDu7eS00SeO.ogg"},{"description":"hare_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"大家，退后。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/KwIL4mzwAVn1LbufSOhZg3Hpz4bxt8HZ.ogg"},{"description":"hare_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"虽然是一件旧武器，不过这件武器里面，包含着无法量化的记忆。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/TF0ALiIPRF6ifSGDUAFiKu8WhOb2k95R.ogg"},{"description":"hare_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"证明我实力的机会到了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Zfi9g3sIl0WkGHd3wm1E4eljdYQxPi4O.ogg"},{"description":"hare_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"交给我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/elwffc7cpHYDJFeSko5WG8n1fMthgBfs.ogg"},{"description":"hare_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"很高兴认识你，老师。我会让老师见识一下，千禧年的实力。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/5kIYKXyj9rmIkwdul1aV9f7qQ048GM2o.ogg"},{"description":"hare_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"嗯——效果还挺惊人的嘛。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Qov1gv8iajdMhGy8SQgHTtWweS3k05h4.ogg"},{"description":"hare_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"我还需要更多的数据。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/1wUnZoja1LmhKlAQ9uAjYN6W4hmN2p9E.ogg"},{"description":"hare_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"涌现出来的这股力量，能不能量化出来呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/mfMYva3a25iQ3EHiiHMhNlVDa7jvC21P.ogg"},{"description":"hare_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"探索未知的知识，总是很有趣的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/rTg4LGzGhrmQlZuibZSmTCwuoD9eKif2.ogg"},{"description":"hare_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"看不出来吧，我超会打游戏的哦。老师要不要和我比试一下？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/AcZpyFm06Wc47yLXMGY9NuQNm0O7MOhj.ogg"},{"description":"hare_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"作弊......？虽然我是黑客，但是打游戏最重要的是开心嘛。我不会作弊的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/1NLtZNf8DtTJQcmXtGJfyIM6mc2y6yxJ.ogg"},{"description":"hare_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"在你看来，我们做的事情有那么极端吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/YSdD70mzZDvdAF6uAmEZBUwb9kYJlA2s.ogg"},{"description":"hare_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"知识应该是自由的......嗯，这句话说的真好。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/A9xnNLMixS4uyRHApIxOXXWigDoGznOH.ogg"},{"description":"hare_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"这种甜甜的碳酸饮料，才是高智商人士该喝的东西呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/JPFa1Ta6XMsp1F9KS5R8yI9Z6xL4S7vb.ogg"},{"description":"hare_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"呀，老师。来杯咖啡吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/7KVKEDdLQq4r58gM6i8Cim797cJr7FY8.ogg"},{"description":"hare_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师，欢迎你。你比我预测的早到了43秒。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/XcaTMrKs3uRJz8wuLbxN7EzwXeWwiWLb.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯......怎么突然下雨了......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/bWZJ5qlruM4aDF2f4hKaGfLwlK0P5t40.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"最近连天气预报都不敢信了，真麻烦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/BNzpRgeBbYq60kTcIlucoy9pJkF0UfoW.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，接下来该干什么呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/VytrOkmOU4uGGdY6jOV6OgmP2aZ9FLQP.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"额，我刚才说的话，不会让人误解成什么不好的意思吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/1ALEAFZHJ910MPxwjIu5h5EPG7EqzHOF.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"可我第一次来网吧这种地方，也不知道别人一般会在这里干什么......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/ECkGBeKP3InQB8Ybhp9vO03mIxeBievE.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"而且这里，也太窄了......老师的脸，好近......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Syl7l72SUunMZz9yQBQmob5JzSJUD2MX.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"欸？你要先去洗个澡？等下，为什么？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/gKQtrGq8MnqAqDFgmxAs2RQbjNt3HIul.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊？头发淋湿了，要去洗一下？对不起，没事，当我没说吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/5nU0fb7sR3wVOduEz6BVLPeFHy284Gtq.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"原来，网吧还有洗澡的地方啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/LZIQJKxJ3AB5jZREbVq7MJHTJl8dFJf5.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师快看，饮料是免费的欸。不知道有没有能量饮料？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Ve2p9usQF7fH5redZgNmNnEsjWjCBpPn.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，网络也能随便用，饮料也不要钱，这也太幸福了。完全就是给我这种人设计的地方啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/9ZLJWXzOx8QQdf61hXymiTsT2sXXFIeP.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_6_1","category":"lobby","text":"要在这里待多久我都愿意。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/o2dHS7imOJJgSEtYsLJkxyUB0F51tWoK.ogg"},{"description":"hare_memoriallobby_6_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，那个......刚才那句话没什么特别的意思，不要误会啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/J2dpauCVOc28RYqNBJHG1K8xsSzNNcxj.ogg"},{"description":"hare_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"等这项研究结束了，下次想研究一下老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/1hudcgh4khcW1mKTHaJYW1G3AulkXRZR.ogg"},{"description":"hare_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"要是人的心灵，也可以用显微镜去观察就好了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/7hqQwC2TawPRSxsKWKwphQbvsqxj0NRh.ogg"},{"description":"hare_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"用什么样的力学，才能证明这颗被老师吸引的心呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/2Cb7JnRfHSEpoQ0KcaaqnNeYs28dZRQ7.ogg"},{"description":"hare_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"你问我的能力能不能让时间倒流？谁知道呢？但是我，很想永远享受现在这个瞬间。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/GXn9gPKMHVCdsnB7e0ofxpFfTKd7L9FN.ogg"},{"description":"hare_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"嗯——我说的树莓派不是这个东西。不过，谢谢你为我庆祝生日。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/T1VT07vd3EXsetx3xZvJ7tiwRAyHvzPB.ogg"},{"description":"hare_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"生日快乐，老师。今天，晴会保佑你，不管写什么代码，都不会出现漏洞。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/Q2eE0QEECHONMMn7aWYQC1xCMN46IXtV.ogg"},{"description":"hare_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"你问我为什么不去外面过节？万圣节的庆典，用显示器也能看嘛。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/z3Ncgn2Xn0GVInAmzOqniIOiXB4uetAJ.ogg"},{"description":"hare_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"Hello, new world.","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/bUuqbzWt4T330SW2uXaotbtkwnnRJY3p.ogg"},{"description":"hare_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"老师，你知道吗？一年之中，圣诞节是发生“那个”次数最多的一天。哼哼，没错。就是——破解入侵哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/93EFH26tWJbMfiugmIzoj2scpKQ7u0oe.ogg"},{"description":"hare_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"今天,是团圆的节日吗?即使是我,也有想待在老师身边的时候呢。 ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/TB1Gr43Hg21eizdNfl6WMUCdOJL2WGn6.ogg"},{"description":"hare_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"希望新的一年里,不要再遇上那么多bug了。 ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/7wgW4Wz1XIJtgk9BaMmbwKuhvMqQePPc.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"Hare_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/original/Hare_Title.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/original/hare_cafe_act_1.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_act_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/original/hare_cafe_act_2.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/original/hare_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/original/hare_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"hare_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E9%92%A9%20%E6%99%B4/original/hare_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"hare_commonskill","category":"bat